# shape: severity-shapes.ttl
# expect: violates
# why: §3.6 makes sh:conforms false when validation produced ANY result. A shape declaring sh:severity sh:Warning still produces one, so the graph does not conform — this engine used to report conforms:true here while pySHACL reported false.
@prefix ex: <https://example.org/severity#> .

ex:t a ex:Thing ; ex:count "not a number" .
